{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaks in Space is a 2D space-sim sandbox featuring Ship Building, Mining &amp; Trading Ores, Combat and surviving with pressurized ship health and exploring mysterious of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/b4f9857e4cc7bb6bc7a5be7c15351851.webp?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=50 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your OWN ship part by part with unique functional components, equip railguns and versatile turrets. Protect your ship Core with hull and armor to survive the harsh zones of the space. The more cargo components you install, the more ore you can haul!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/11ffdca5c0cd1aad9dbefc3e41ad2b59.poster.avif?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/11ffdca5c0cd1aad9dbefc3e41ad2b59.webm?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/11ffdca5c0cd1aad9dbefc3e41ad2b59.mp4?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/0db5e4e32f42a7d66924a03eec6dbf58.webp?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine asteroids to collect raw resources that can be traded with Space stations. Resources are also useful to craft High Tier components. Earn Sinc [Syntar Integrated Nanite Credit] through completing the tasks &amp; trading. Use the Sinc to buy more ship parts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/88c109052729fa0d5d1152214f6bbe26.poster.avif?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/88c109052729fa0d5d1152214f6bbe26.webm?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/88c109052729fa0d5d1152214f6bbe26.mp4?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/da8743e19d80739cdea6b23b26221311.webp?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down the space pirate ships and kill them to gain rewards. During combat, you have to monitor the pressure of your ship constantly. On command, your drones will help you fix the leaks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/a3e0b637427950b49ffc297f24fa511c.poster.avif?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/a3e0b637427950b49ffc297f24fa511c.webm?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/a3e0b637427950b49ffc297f24fa511c.mp4?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/7e94b063718505866c130768ce87ed59.webp?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sectors through jump gates, discover rich asteroid belts, uncover secrets of a forgotten Empire.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/f96b418af487a0d3a9942bbf49e3ae79.poster.avif?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/f96b418af487a0d3a9942bbf49e3ae79.webm?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/f96b418af487a0d3a9942bbf49e3ae79.mp4?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/17f2582f2938cc68247f7a64d7f99907.webp?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Our goal is to continue developing and evolving Leaks in Space, guided by the feedback of the players and support of the Community.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561170?t=1771571274","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/21738797f274031c4c8b0f15f05263cd21a7835f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771571274","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/6f8851411a82d1e2d9e40049a9474343b78c38a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771571274","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/6f8851411a82d1e2d9e40049a9474343b78c38a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771571274","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/d1c74610ba3d3fbb60e0b0682eb01d3e.avif?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=832 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaks in Space is a 2D space-sim sandbox featuring Ship Building, Mining &amp; Trading Ores, Combat and surviving with pressurized ship health and exploring mysterious of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/b4f9857e4cc7bb6bc7a5be7c15351851.webp?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=50 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your OWN ship part by part with unique functional components, equip railguns and versatile turrets. Protect your ship Core with hull and armor to survive the harsh zones of the space. The more cargo components you install, the more ore you can haul!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/11ffdca5c0cd1aad9dbefc3e41ad2b59.poster.avif?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/11ffdca5c0cd1aad9dbefc3e41ad2b59.webm?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/11ffdca5c0cd1aad9dbefc3e41ad2b59.mp4?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/0db5e4e32f42a7d66924a03eec6dbf58.webp?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine asteroids to collect raw resources that can be traded with Space stations. Resources are also useful to craft High Tier components. Earn Sinc [Syntar Integrated Nanite Credit] through completing the tasks &amp; trading. Use the Sinc to buy more ship parts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/88c109052729fa0d5d1152214f6bbe26.poster.avif?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/88c109052729fa0d5d1152214f6bbe26.webm?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/88c109052729fa0d5d1152214f6bbe26.mp4?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/da8743e19d80739cdea6b23b26221311.webp?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down the space pirate ships and kill them to gain rewards. During combat, you have to monitor the pressure of your ship constantly. On command, your drones will help you fix the leaks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/a3e0b637427950b49ffc297f24fa511c.poster.avif?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/a3e0b637427950b49ffc297f24fa511c.webm?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/a3e0b637427950b49ffc297f24fa511c.mp4?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/7e94b063718505866c130768ce87ed59.webp?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sectors through jump gates, discover rich asteroid belts, uncover secrets of a forgotten Empire.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/f96b418af487a0d3a9942bbf49e3ae79.poster.avif?t=1771571274\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/f96b418af487a0d3a9942bbf49e3ae79.webm?t=1771571274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/f96b418af487a0d3a9942bbf49e3ae79.mp4?t=1771571274\" typ